issue.body:
Context fields disappear when I redirect a logger to a different writer.

```ts
import { NewLogger, StdoutWriter } from "ctx-log";

const base = NewLogger(StdoutWriter).With().String("service", "api").Logger();
base.Info().Msg("a");                       // {"level":"info","service":"api","message":"a"}
base.Output(StdoutWriter).Info().Msg("b");  // {"level":"info","message":"b"}  <- service missing
```

Expected the second line to still contain `"service":"api"`. In `Logger.Output` a `newContext` array is built but never assigned to the new logger.

ctx-log 0.0.7 / Node v18.19.0
